{
  "name": "Save Gmail attachments to Google Drive with a log sheet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "q": "has:attachment -from:me",
          "readStatus": "unread"
        },
        "options": {
          "downloadAttachments": true
        }
      },
      "id": "4c2eb3cc-f99f-5794-bb9a-05108737250b",
      "name": "New email with attachment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"drive_folder_id\": \"PASTE_FOLDER_ID_FROM_THE_FOLDER_URL\",\n    \"only_from\": [],\n    \"sheet_url\": \"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SHEET_ID/edit\",\n    \"sheet_tab\": \"Saved attachments\"\n  }\n}",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "9e92ffc2-7554-559b-9f74-465dc50b2357",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const cfg = $('Settings').first().json.config;\nconst only = (cfg.only_from || []).map((s) => String(s).toLowerCase());\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $('New email with attachment').all()) {\n  const from = String((item.json.from && item.json.from.value && item.json.from.value[0] && item.json.from.value[0].address) || '').toLowerCase();\n  if (only.length && !only.some((o) => o.startsWith('@') ? from.endsWith(o) : from === o)) continue;\n  const date = new Date(item.json.date || Date.now()).toISOString().slice(0, 10);\n  for (const [key, bin] of Object.entries(item.binary || {})) {\n    out.push({ json: { from, subject: item.json.subject || '', file_name: `${date} ${from.split('@')[0]} - ${bin.fileName || key}` },\n      binary: { data: bin } });\n  }\n}\nreturn out;"
      },
      "id": "6e894d07-eaee-5de0-b59f-40fc5267fbc9",
      "name": "One item per attachment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "name": "={{ $json.file_name }}",
        "driveId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "list",
          "value": "My Drive"
        },
        "folderId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.drive_folder_id }}"
        },
        "inputDataFieldName": "data",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "aa2b5041-b713-58b5-ae97-4db69978b290",
      "name": "Upload to Google Drive",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleDrive",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return $input.all().map((item, i) => { const src = $('One item per attachment').all()[i].json;\n  return { json: { saved_at: new Date().toISOString(), from: src.from, subject: src.subject, file_name: src.file_name, drive_link: item.json.webViewLink || '' } }; });"
      },
      "id": "85af526a-b085-5016-a3b2-3492326e184a",
      "name": "Log row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_url }}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_tab }}"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {
          "cellFormat": "RAW",
          "handlingExtraData": "ignoreIt"
        }
      },
      "id": "0cd759b5-df00-5b87-a216-8055e0bfd595",
      "name": "Save to sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        1200,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Save Gmail attachments to Google Drive with a log sheet\nEvery attachment you receive (optionally only from chosen senders) is saved to a Drive folder with a clear name and logged in a sheet.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "8906299c-724b-5b2f-a218-5e21b8f472d7",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -420
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Create a Drive folder and copy the ID from its URL (the part after /folders/) into **Settings**. Optional: `only_from` limits it to certain senders or `@domain.com`.\n2. Make a sheet tab **Saved attachments** with the headers in `sheet-headers.csv` and put its URL in **Settings**.\n3. Connect Gmail, Google Drive and Google Sheets.\n4. Send yourself an email with an attachment, then switch to **Active**.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "f1f3d964-50e3-518e-b185-966caa8c1abb",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        400,
        -420
      ]
    }
  ],
